    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ANNA: You stay here. They're trying to kill me.\nVERONA: Marishka, my dear, please kill the stranger.\nMARISHKA: Love to.",
      "VERONA: Be happy in the knowledge that your blood shall keep me beautiful.\nANNA: Who are you trying to kill?!\nANNA: The sun.",
      "ALEERA: Do you know how long I have wanted to kill you?\nANNA: Aleera, did I do something to you in a past life?\nALEERA: Don't play coy with me, Princess, you're just like all the other pretty little ancestors in your family. Saying you want to destroy my maste…\nANNA: I hope you have a heart, Aleera, because someday I'm going to drive a stake through it.",
      "VERONA: Hello, Anna, my dear.\nANNA: You won't have me, Verona.\nVERONA: The last of the Valerious.",
      "ALEERA: Do we mean so little to you!?\nVERONA: Have you no heart!"
    ]
  },
